# ═══ Godot 4 ═══
# Cache editor / import (shader cache, .import, uid_cache) — dibuat ulang otomatis
godot/.godot/
godot/**/*.import

# ═══ Hasil export Godot (APK/AAB keluaran build-android-godot.yml / editor) ═══
godot/build/

# ═══ Hasil "Godot Debug Run" ═══
# Keluaran tools/godot_debug_run.py + godot/scenes/debug/DebugRun.tscn:
# shots/*.png, run.log, report.json, summary.md, movie.avi|mp4, userdata/
# (save terisolasi). Ratusan PNG per run TIDAK boleh masuk git — di CI isinya
# diunggah sebagai artifact .github/workflows/godot-run.yml, di lokal dilihat
# langsung dari folder ini.
debug_out/

# ═══ Duplikat aset biner untuk project Godot (hasil
# tools/convert_to_godot.py [--assets]; sumber kebenaran tetap assets/ pygame).
# res:// tidak bisa keluar dari root project Godot, jadi salinannya wajib ada
# di dalam godot/ saat runtime/export:
#   sounds/     24 .wav  -> AudioManager.gd   (di-gitignore, ±16 MB)
#   presplash   boot splash Android -> application/boot_splash/image
# CI menyalinnya sebelum `godot --import` / export AAB.
#
# Pengecualian: items/ (33 ikon ITEM FORGE, ±3 MB) SEKARANG IKUT REPO supaya
# ikon terbaca di SEMUA lingkungan — editor (F5 tanpa converter), export
# desktop lokal, "Godot Debug Run", maupun AAB — tanpa menunggu langkah
# salin CI. Sebelumnya folder ini di-gitignore dan gejala "ikon item cuma
# kotak warna" muncul tiap run yang lupa menjalankan converter. Converter
# tetap menyalin ulang (byte identik) bila assets/items/ pygame berubah. ═══
godot/assets/sounds/
godot/assets/presplash.png
godot/gdext/mystic_skills/.sconsign.dblite
godot/gdext/mystic_skills/src/*.os
godot/gdext/mystic_levels/.sconsign.dblite
godot/gdext/mystic_levels/src/*.os
godot/gdext/mystic_lighting/.sconsign.dblite
godot/gdext/mystic_lighting/src/*.os
godot/gdext/mystic_ui/.sconsign.dblite
godot/gdext/mystic_ui/src/*.os
godot/gdext/mystic_mobile/.sconsign.dblite
godot/gdext/mystic_mobile/src/*.os
godot/gdext/mystic_maps/.sconsign.dblite
godot/gdext/mystic_maps/src/*.os
godot/gdext/mystic_splash/.sconsign.dblite
godot/gdext/mystic_splash/src/*.os

